# Scratch space for test/run-all.sh and test/run-frontend.sh — seed
# output and server logs for each suite. The test database itself lives
# in PostgreSQL (TEST_DATABASE_URL), not a file, so there's nothing to
# ignore for it here; this directory only ever holds throwaway
# test-run artifacts, never the real application database.
test/tmp/
